<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield</p>
<p>cricket standings after the match completed on Sunday (tabulate</p>
<p>under played, won outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on</p>
<p>first innings, lost outright, points):</p>
<p> Queensland		4   3   1   0   0   0   20</p>
<p> Tasmania		  4   1   1   0   1   1    8</p>
<p> New South Wales	 4   1   1   0   1   1    7.8</p>
<p> Western Australia     2   1   0   0   0   1    6</p>
<p> Victoria		  4   1   0   0   1   2    5.7</p>
<p> South Australia	 2   0   0   0   0   2    0</p>
<p>Note: New South Wales penalised 0.2 points for slow over</p>
<p>rate in their match against Tasmania, Victoria penalised 0.3</p>
<p>points for the same reason in the game against New South Wales.</p>
</text>
